              "answer": "Concerning imposition of hands, this once served its time, and there is no need of preserving it now, for through imposition of hands one cannot bestow the Holy Spirit, for this belongs only to God. Concerning ecclesiastical orders, we believe that which has been written by Saint Paul in the first letter to Timothy and in other places.",
