            {
              "id": "c01_4",
              "label": "4",
              "question": null,
              "answer": "The authority of the Holy Scripture, for which it ought to be believed, and obeyed, dependeth not upon the testimony of any man, or Church; but wholly upon God (who is truth itself) the author thereof: and therefore it is to be received because it is the Word of God.",
              "proofs": [
