        {
          "number": "6",
          "title": "Of the Fall of Man, of Sin, and of the Punishment Thereof",
          "entries": [
            {
              "id": "c06_1",
              "label": "1",
              "question": null,
              "answer": "Our first parents, being seduced by the subtlety and temptation of Satan, sinned, in eating the forbidden fruit. This their sin, God was pleased, according to His wise and holy counsel, to permit, having purposed to order it to His own glory.",
              "proofs": [
                {
                  "id": 1,
                  "refs": [
                    {
                      "osis": "Genesis.3_13",
                      "display": "Genesis 3:13"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": 2,
                  "refs": [
                    {
                      "osis": "Romans.11_32",
                      "display": "Romans 11:32"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": 3,
                  "refs": [
                    {
                      "osis": "2.Corinthians.11_3",
                      "display": "2 Corinthians 11:3"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "c06_2",
              "label": "2",
              "question": null,
              "answer": "By this sin they fell from their original righteousness and communion with God, and so became dead in sin, and wholly defiled in all the parts and faculties of soul and body.",
              "proofs": [
                {
                  "id": 1,
                  "refs": [
                    {
                      "osis": "Genesis.2_17",
                      "display": "Genesis 2:17"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": 2,
                  "refs": [
                    {
                      "osis": "Genesis.3_6-8",
                      "display": "Genesis 3:6-8"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": 3,
                  "refs": [
                    {
                      "osis": "Genesis.6_5",
                      "display": "Genesis 6:5"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": 4,
