                },
                {
                  "id": 6,
                  "refs": [
                    {
                      "osis": "Romans.8_1",
                      "display": "Romans 8:1"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "c15_5",
              "label": "5",
              "question": null,
              "answer": "Men ought not to content themselves with a general repentance, but it is every man’s duty to endeavour to repent of his particular sins, particularly.",
              "proofs": [
                {
                  "id": 1,
                  "refs": [
                    {
                      "osis": "Psalm.19_13",
                      "display": "Psalm 19:13"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": 2,
                  "refs": [
                    {
                      "osis": "Luke.19_8",
                      "display": "Luke 19:8"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": 3,
                  "refs": [
                    {
                      "osis": "1.Timothy.1_13~15",
                      "display": "1 Timothy 1:13,15"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "c15_6",
              "label": "6",
              "question": null,
              "answer": "As every man is bound to make private confession of his sins to God, praying for the pardon thereof; upon which, and the forsaking of them, he shall find mercy; so, he that scandaliseth his brother, or the Church of Christ, ought to be willing, by a private or public confession, and sorrow for his sin, to declare his repentance to those that are offended, who are thereupon to be reconciled to him, and in love to receive him.",
              "proofs": [
                {
                  "id": 1,
                  "refs": [
                    {
                      "osis": "Joshua.7_19",
                      "display": "Joshua 7:19"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
