                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "c11_4",
              "label": "4",
              "question": null,
              "answer": "God did from all eternity decree to justify all the elect, and Christ did in the fullness of time die for their sins, and rise again for their justification; nevertheless, they are not justified personally, until the Holy Spirit doth in due time actually apply Christ unto them.",
              "proofs": [
