                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "c13_2",
              "label": "2",
              "question": null,
              "answer": "This sanctification is throughout the whole man, yet imperfect in this life; there abideth still some remnants of corruption in every part, whence ariseth a continual and irreconcilable war; the flesh lusting against the Spirit, and the Spirit against the flesh.",
              "proofs": [
