Urban; Urbschat, Hela; Vasel; v. Viebahn; Wächter, Frankfurt; Wallraff, Berlin; Warns, Berlin; Wittekindt; Wüsten, Görlitz; v. Zastrow, Gr. Breesen. Approvals were requested from Wittekindt in Wernigerode. 56 brothers signed the declaration; four brothers refused their approval.",
